{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/7439","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:48.415271+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"seems like a regression, jaxlib 0.1.68 produces the exception\r\n\r\n```\r\nERROR:absl:Outside call <function _call.<locals>.<lambda> at 0x7f04e2fd2dd0> threw exception Error!.\r\nERROR:absl:Postponing exception raised in callback function: Traceback (most recent call last):\r\n  File \"/usr/local/google/home/zhangqiaorjc/repos/jax/jax/experimental/host_callback.py\", line 1747, in _callback_input_received\r\n    return callback(arrays, device)\r\n  File \"/usr/local/google/home/zhangqiaorjc/repos/jax/jax/experimental/host_callback.py\", line 1156, in _outside_call_run_callback\r\n    raise e  # Let the exception propagate\r\n  File \"/usr/local/google/home/zhangqiaorjc/repos/jax/jax/experimental/host_callback.py\", line 1099, in _outside_call_run_callback\r\n    res = callback(arg, device, unpacked_transforms)\r\n  File \"/usr/local/google/home/zhangqiaorjc/repos/jax/jax/experimental/host_callback.py\", line 689, in <lambda>\r\n    callback = lambda arg, device, transforms: callback_func(arg, transforms)\r\n  File \"hcb_repro.py\", line 5, in callback\r\n    raise RuntimeError('Error!')\r\nRuntimeError: Error!\r\n\r\nThere were exceptions during callback processing. Last one was: Traceback (most recent call last):\r\n  File \"/usr/local/google/home/zhangqiaorjc/repos/jax/jax/experimental/host_callback.py\", line 1747, in _callback_input_received\r\n    return callback(arrays, device)\r\n  File \"/usr/local/google/home/zhangqiaorjc/repos/jax/jax/experimental/host_callback.py\", line 1156, in _outside_call_run_callback\r\n    raise e  # Let the exception propagate\r\n  File \"/usr/local/google/home/zhangqiaorjc/repos/jax/jax/experimental/host_callback.py\", line 1099, in _outside_call_run_callback\r\n    res = callback(arg, device, unpacked_transforms)\r\n  File \"/usr/local/google/home/zhangqiaorjc/repos/jax/jax/experimental/host_callback.py\", line 689, in <lambda>\r\n    callback = lambda arg, device, transforms: callback_func(arg, transforms)\r\n  File \"hcb_repro.py\", line 5, in callback\r\n    raise RuntimeError('Error!')\r\nRuntimeError: Error!\r\n```\r\n\r\nBut jaxlib 0.1.69 crashes\r\n\r\n```\r\nWARNING:absl:No GPU/TPU found, falling back to CPU. (Set TF_CPP_MIN_LOG_LEVEL=0 and rerun for more info.)\r\nERROR:absl:Outside call <function _call.<locals>.<lambda> at 0x7fab217f1dd0> threw exception Error!.\r\nterminate called after throwing an instance of 'pybind11::error_already_set'\r\n  what():  RuntimeError: Error!\r\n\r\nAt:\r\n  hcb_repro.py(5): callback\r\n  /usr/local/google/home/zhangqiaorjc/repos/jax/jax/experimental/host_callback.py(689): <lambda>\r\n  /usr/local/google/home/zhangqiaorjc/repos/jax/jax/experimental/host_callback.py(1156): _outside_call_run_callback\r\n  /usr/local/google/home/zhangqiaorjc/repos/jax/jax/experimental/host_callback.py(1025): wrapped_callback\r\n  /usr/local/google/home/zhangqiaorjc/repos/jax/jax/interpreters/xla.py(893): _execute_compiled\r\n  /usr/local/google/home/zhangqiaorjc/repos/jax/jax/interpreters/xla.py(249): apply_primitive\r\n  /usr/local/google/home/zhangqiaorjc/repos/jax/jax/experimental/host_callback.py(911): _outside_call_impl\r\n  /usr/local/google/home/zhangqiaorjc/repos/jax/jax/core.py(603): process_primitive\r\n  /usr/local/google/home/zhangqiaorjc/repos/jax/jax/core.py(264): bind\r\n  /usr/local/google/home/zhangqiaorjc/repos/jax/jax/experimental/host_callback.py(714): _call\r\n  /usr/local/google/home/zhangqiaorjc/repos/jax/jax/experimental/host_callback.py(584): id_tap\r\n  hcb_repro.py(8): <module>\r\n```","created_at":"2021-08-03T22:30:11Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/7439#issuecomment-892208496","id":892208496,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/7439","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc41LgVw","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/892208496/reactions"},"updated_at":"2021-08-03T22:30:11Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/892208496","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/328992?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqiaorjc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqiaorjc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqiaorjc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqiaorjc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangqiaorjc","id":328992,"login":"zhangqiaorjc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODk5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqiaorjc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqiaorjc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqiaorjc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqiaorjc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqiaorjc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqiaorjc","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"The issue comes from the fact that with ` jaxlib 0.1.68` the host_callback module on CPU uses a different implementation mechanism than on GPU and TPU: instead of outfeed it uses by default an XLA CustomCall. This will eventually be rolled out to GPU also, but not TPU. (You can force the use of outfeed even on CPU with `JAX_HOST_CALLBACK_OUTFEED=True`)\r\n\r\nThe proper solution is to get the XLA CustomCall to throw a proper Python exception, not crash. This should be possible. ","created_at":"2021-08-13T08:24:14Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/7439#issuecomment-898280416","id":898280416,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/7439","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc41iqvg","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/898280416/reactions"},"updated_at":"2021-08-13T08:24:14Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/898280416","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3890983?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gnecula","id":3890983,"login":"gnecula","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4OTA5ODM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"It seems that doing this depends on rolling out a [new feature for CustomCall](https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/blob/ea0b101ff548d4c59bc83acc5adf4bff91a33184/tensorflow/compiler/xla/service/hlo.proto#L60-L63), to enable it to return a status. ","created_at":"2021-08-13T15:27:16Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/7439#issuecomment-898542728","id":898542728,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/7439","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc41jqyI","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/898542728/reactions"},"updated_at":"2021-08-13T15:27:16Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/898542728","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3890983?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gnecula","id":3890983,"login":"gnecula","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4OTA5ODM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"On jaxlib==0.1.73 I again get a `RuntimeError`. Did JAX by chance switch the host callback method because I don't think the CustomCall implementation in XLA was changed for the CPU (https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/commits/master/tensorflow/compiler/xla/service/hlo.proto)?\r\n\r\nAnyways, this bug might potentially be outdated.","created_at":"2021-11-13T10:58:01Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/7439#issuecomment-968050058","id":968050058,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/7439","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc45s0WK","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/968050058/reactions"},"updated_at":"2021-11-13T10:58:01Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/968050058","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7541458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Edenhofer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Edenhofer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Edenhofer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Edenhofer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Edenhofer","id":7541458,"login":"Edenhofer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1NDE0NTg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Edenhofer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Edenhofer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Edenhofer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Edenhofer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Edenhofer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Edenhofer","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"Nothing has changed on the host_callback side, but it seems that there were changes in the way XLA CustomCall handles exceptions. Now, instead of crashing the runtime the exception from the called Python function is propagated properly up the call stack. \r\n\r\nI think that this is a step in the right direction. However, the behavior is still slightly different depending on the JAX_HOST_CALLBACK_OUTFEED environment variable (default False on CPU and True on other platforms). If we use outfeed then the `CallbackException` error comes from `hcb.barrier_wait`, otherwise the actual exception comes directly from the `hcb.id_tap` function.","created_at":"2021-11-17T08:55:37Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/7439#issuecomment-971368117","id":971368117,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/7439","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc455e